The WCD calculation is based on the equation:

WCD = (deadline - (payload / bandwidth)) + (propagation_delay + switching_delay + time_synchronization_error) \* hop_count

where:

* deadline is the deadline of the flow in microseconds
* payload is the payload of the flow in bytes
* bandwidth is the bandwidth of the link in Mbps
* propagation_delay is the propagation delay of the link in microseconds
* switching_delay is the switching delay of the switch in microseconds
* time_synchronization_error is the time synchronization error in microseconds
* hop_count is the number of hops in the path of the flow

